  WP-C: Staff Lifecycle, Access Control & Lockout Prevention
    1. Safe Staff Invitations (POST /api/staff/invitations)
      √ Super Admin can invite staff with any allowed role in any active lab (68 ms)
      √ Lab Manager can invite subordinate staff to own lab (50 ms)
      √ Lab Manager cannot invite staff to a foreign lab (403 Forbidden) (11 ms)
      √ Lab Manager cannot invite a peer Manager or Admin role (403 Forbidden) (10 ms)
      √ Invitation rejects email that already has an account (409 Conflict) (11 ms)
      √ Invitation to paused/inactive lab is rejected with 400 LAB_PAUSED (12 ms)
    2. Pre-change Access Review Preview (POST /api/users/:id/access-preview)
      √ Calculates open work assignments and capability diff with signed reviewToken (16 ms)
      √ Manager previewing user in another lab is rejected with 403 (11 ms)
    3. Applying Access Changes & Session Revocation (PATCH /api/users/:id/access)
      √ Demoting user updates role, increments tokenVersion, and invalidates active session (30 ms)
      √ Demoting the last remaining Super Admin is blocked with 403 LAST_ADMIN_PROTECTED (19 ms)
    4. Staff Suspension & Lockout Protection (POST /api/users/:id/suspend)
      √ Self-suspension is strictly forbidden with 400 SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN (14 ms)
      √ Suspending last super administrator is blocked with 403 LAST_ADMIN_PROTECTED (14 ms)
      √ Manager suspends subordinate: sets isActive=false, bumps tokenVersion, flags open work (27 ms)
    5. Staff Reactivation (POST /api/users/:id/reactivate)
      √ Reactivating user sets isActive=true and preserves session revocation (new tokenVersion) (29 ms)
      √ Reactivating user whose laboratory is paused/inactive is rejected with 400 LAB_PAUSED (20 ms)
    6. Emergency Single-Use Recovery Grants (POST /api/users/:id/recovery)
      √ Manager can issue single-use recovery grant for own lab staff (14 ms)
      √ Manager cannot issue recovery grant for foreign lab staff (403 Forbidden) (14 ms)
    7. Self-Profile Scope Enforcement (PATCH /api/auth/profile)
      √ User can update own name, language, and theme preference (22 ms)
      √ User cannot inject administrative fields (role, labId, projects, countries) (10 ms)

